---
import CtaBoton from '../layout/CtaBoton.astro';
---

<section class="drift" id="drift" data-screen-label="04 Drift">
  <div class="drift-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="drift-hot"><span class="pulse"></span> ESPECIALIDAD DESTACADA</div>
      <h2>¿Tu joystick<br/>tiene <span class="red">drift?</span></h2>
      <p>¿El personaje se mueve solo? ¿Los botones no responden bien? Reparamos joysticks de PS4, PS5 y Xbox con repuestos de calidad.</p>
      <p>Diagnóstico, cambio de joystick analógico, calibración y prueba antes de devolvértelo.</p>
      <ul class="drift-list">
        <li><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span> DualSense (PS5)</li>
        <li><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span> DualShock 4 (PS4)</li>
        <li><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span> Xbox Series X / S</li>
        <li><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span> Repuestos de calidad</li>
        <li><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span> Calibración y prueba</li>
        <li><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span> Garantía en el trabajo</li>
      </ul>
      <CtaBoton
        href="https://wa.me/5493444569948?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20consultar%20por%20reparaci%C3%B3n%20de%20joystick"
        texto="Consultar por mi joystick"
        variante="wa"
        icono="wa"
        externo
      />
    </div>
    <div class="drift-visual">
      <div class="ring r1"></div>
      <div class="ring r2"></div>
      <div class="ring r3"></div>
      <div class="stick"></div>
      <div class="label-bottom">DRIFT DETECTED</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
